OL,3,GNEWSABoy starts school after spending
OL,4,AChristmas in coma
OL,5,
OL,6,FA four-year-old boy has started school
OL,7,Fthis week, less than a year after he
OL,8,Fspent Christmas in a coma.
OL,10,FOliver, from Wakefield, was in Leeds
OL,11,FGeneral Infirmary for five months after
OL,12,Fhe was diagnosed with a type of blood
OL,13,Fcancer in 2025.
OL,15,FDespite the brutal side effects he
OL,16,Fsuffered, doctors managed to
OL,17,Fsuccessfully treat Oliver and he is now
OL,18,Fin remission, having left hospital on
OL,19,FNew Year's Day.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
